				],
				"text": "One of the challenges that any large organisation faces is how to provide supportive and high performing working environments that make the best use of their property portfolios. Architecture Matters regularly works with our institutional clients to help deliver new workplace solutions.\n\nThe project brief for the refurbishment of the existing two storey office building at Norwood Crescent, Moonee Ponds was to create a flexible and inviting workspace suitable for project and team-based collaboration as well as hosting presentations and meetings for external colleagues for the Northern Region Office of Catholic Education Melbourne."
			}
		},
