					"width": 853,
					"height": 569
				},
				"align": "left"
			}
		},
		{
			"discriminant": "text_image",
			"value": {
				"text": "Being an older office building, it did not comply with modern accessibility standards. We added an accessible-compliant toilet and shower facility to the ground floor and completed the preparatory work for the future installation of an accessible-compliant passenger lift.\n\nA modern and calming palette of materials brings the workplace into alignment with The Catholic Education Office’s other office buildings.",
